            0.204,
            0.465,
            0.846,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": "(i) In 1983, the majority in rural areas used kerosene as a primary lighting source while the majority in urban areas used electricity."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.525,
            0.845,
            0.564
          ],
          "content": "(ii) The use of kerosene as a primary lighting source has decreased over time in both rural and urban areas."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.568,
            0.846,
            0.607
          ],
          "content": "(iii) In the year 2000, 10% of the urban households used electricity as a primary lighting source."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.611,
            0.575,
            0.631
          ],
          "content": "(iv) In 2023, there were no power cuts."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.64,
            0.735,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": "11. Answer the following questions based on the line graph."
